    "Finished books. They keep their progress — unarchive anytime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abgeschlossene Bücher. Ihr Fortschritt bleibt — jederzeit wieder hervorholbar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuadernos terminados. Conservan tu progreso — puedes recuperarlos cuando quieras."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Carnets terminés. Ils gardent ta progression — à ressortir quand tu veux."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "終えたブックです。進み具合はそのまま残り、いつでも戻せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "끝낸 책이에요. 진행 상황은 그대로 남고, 언제든 다시 꺼낼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读完的复习本。进度都会保留，随时可以取消封存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讀完的複習本。進度都會保留，隨時可以取消封存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finishing puts you in line — it doesn't seat you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Completarlo te pone en la cola — no te da la plaza."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aller au bout te met dans la file — ça ne te donne pas la place."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "埋めきると待機列に並びます。すぐに席に着くわけではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다 채우면 대기 줄에 서요. 바로 앉는 건 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "达成后会排进队伍，不是马上有席位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "達成後會排進隊伍，不是馬上有席位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five minutes at the same time every day — small enough that you actually do it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cinco minutos a la misma hora cada día — tan poco que de verdad lo haces."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cinq minutes à la même heure chaque jour — assez peu pour le faire vraiment."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎日同じ時間に5分。実際にやれるくらい小さく。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "매일 같은 시간에 5분. 실제로 하게 될 만큼 작게."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天同一时间5分钟。小到你真的做得到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天同一時間5分鐘。小到你真的做得到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fluent, flexible, and precise — even on complex topics." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fließend, flexibel und präzise — auch bei komplexen Themen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con fluidez, flexibilidad y precisión, incluso en temas complejos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fluide, souple et précis, même sur des sujets complexes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複雑な話題でも流暢に、柔軟に、正確に話せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "복잡한 주제에서도 유창하고 유연하고 정확해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就算是复杂的话题，也能说得流畅、灵活又精准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就算是複雜的話題，也能說得流暢、靈活又精準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
