    "No Bluetooth earbuds — AirPods record at phone-call quality, and the clone won't sound like you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin auriculares Bluetooth: los AirPods graban con calidad de llamada y el clon no sonará como tú."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pas d’écouteurs Bluetooth : les AirPods enregistrent en qualité téléphone, et le clone ne te ressemblera pas."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bluetoothイヤホンは使えません。AirPodsは通話音質で録音されるので、自分の声らしく聞こえなくなります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "블루투스 이어폰은 안 돼요. 에어팟은 통화 음질로 녹음돼서, 목소리가 나처럼 들리지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要用蓝牙耳机。AirPods会以通话音质录音，做出来的声音不像你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要用藍牙耳機。AirPods會以通話音質錄音，做出來的聲音不像你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No charge during the beta. Looking at the planned launch prices, which would you actually subscribe to?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In der Beta fallen keine Kosten an. Welchen der geplanten Startpreise würdest du wirklich abonnieren?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante la beta no se cobra nada. Viendo los precios previstos para el lanzamiento, ¿a cuál te suscribirías de verdad?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendant la bêta, rien n’est facturé. En regardant les prix prévus au lancement, auquel t’abonnerais-tu vraiment ?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ベータ期間中は料金がかかりません。正式リリース時の予定価格を見て、実際に登録するならどちらですか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "베타 기간에는 요금이 없어요. 정식 출시 예정 가격을 봤을 때, 어느 쪽을 실제로 구독하시겠어요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试期间不收费。看了预定的正式上线价格，你实际上会订阅哪一个？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測試期間不收費。看了預定的正式上線價格，你實際上會訂閱哪一個？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No daily goals set — tap to pick how many words, expressions and shadow takes make a day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
