      },
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "So — how did the interview go yesterday? Anything you'd do differently next time?" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Some unusual usage needs checking. Write to us and we'll sort it out — everything you've saved is untouched, and reviewing still works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hay un uso poco habitual que estamos revisando. Escríbenos y lo resolvemos enseguida: todo lo que has guardado sigue intacto y puedes seguir repasando."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un usage inhabituel est en cours de vérification. Écris-nous et on règle ça tout de suite : tout ce que tu as enregistré est intact, et tu peux continuer à réviser."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "普段と違う使われ方があり、確認しています。メールをいただければすぐに対応します。保存したものはそのままで、復習も続けられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "평소와 다른 사용이 있어 확인하고 있어요. 메일을 보내 주시면 바로 정리해 드릴게요. 저장한 건 그대로고, 복습도 계속 할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检测到不太寻常的使用状况，正在确认中。写信给我们，我们会马上处理。你存下的东西都还在，复习也照常可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "偵測到不太尋常的使用狀況，正在確認中。寫信給我們，我們會馬上處理。你存下的東西都還在，複習也照常可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone joined the Core — %lld seats taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
