    "Use them however you like — all in one call today, or spread over the month." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Úsalos como quieras: todos en una llamada hoy o repartidos por el mes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise-les comme tu veux — tout dans un seul appel aujourd’hui, ou réparti sur le mois."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好きなように使えます。今日の1回の通話でまとめて使っても、1か月かけて分けて使っても。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "원하는 대로 쓰면 돼요. 오늘 한 통화에 몰아 써도 되고 한 달에 걸쳐 나눠 써도 돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "怎么用都行。今天一通电话全用掉，或分散在一整个月都可以。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "怎麼用都行。今天一通電話全用掉，或分散在一整個月都可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use them however you like — all in one call today, or spread over the month. There is no daily limit." : {
